417e01b0f93212aba86cb8b46f1dacd73c2.\n\nExact-head PR run 35831950939 passed preflight and the mandatory build. Actual merged-source qualification and freeze run 35832994607 passed. Read-only artifact inspection run 35834032191 verified Git source identity and modes, all 1,085 distribution manifest files, the release hash chain, and the bounded offline inventory.\n\nAutomated suites and extended gameplay, responsive, offline, and device matrices remain explicitly waived under PR #272. They are skipped or deferred, never passed. Public Pages deployment, complete public-byte verification, and bounded native availability remain separate gates.\n\nOriginal source archive: 1,631,959,040 bytes, SHA-256 8efeac922044fc6efb1f5d7c1f660dfaa957e1ee969fd4abcf0275f02f403918.\n\nOriginal distribution: 591,149,699 bytes, SHA-256 60fc0c039dbe04c34d7ac725247e0d21423d16acfefa20ffb9fceda997301634."}